%% title: `atm send`
%% summary: Compose and persist one message, then run post-commit effects.
%% commentary: This path should validate input, commit SQLite first, then run post-commit hooks or advisory nudges without letting any side effect outrun durable truth.
%% sets: cli,client
flowchart TD
    A[send compose request] --> B[Validate actor target and payload]
    B -->|validation error| E1[ValidationFailed]
    B --> C["Build MailStoreMessageRecord
team, agent, message_key, envelope"]
    C --> D["MailStore::upsert_message(
MailStoreUpsertMessageRequest { record }
)
-> Result<MailStoreUpsertMessageResponse, AtmError>"]
    D -->|validation / mailbox write / mailbox lock error| E2[AtmError returned from MailStore boundary]
    D --> N1[Post-commit notification subsystem]
    N1 --> N2[Best-effort post-send hook path]
    N1 --> N3[Generic advisory-nudge routing]
    N2 -->|hook failure| W1[Warning only no rollback]
    N3 -->|queue full or consumer error| W2[Degraded nudge delivery no rollback]
    N2 --> O1[Return send outcome]
    N3 --> O1
